### Fee definition API samples
@host = https://localhost:5001
@owner = 0c250000-50bf-11e7-89e2-1cbdb9e7fd04

### List fees
GET {{host}}/api/fee
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}
X-User-Id: tester

### Create fee
POST {{host}}/api/fee
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}
X-User-Id: tester
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tuition Test",
  "displayText": "Tuition Test",
  "amount": 10000,
  "tags": ["test"],
  "collectStudentWise": true,
  "spansAcademicYears": false,
  "installments": [
    { "installmentNo": 1, "description": "Inst 1", "amount": 5000, "dueDate": "2026-06-01" },
    { "installmentNo": 2, "description": "Inst 2", "amount": 5000, "dueDate": "2026-09-01" }
  ],
  "fines": [
    { "fineNo": 1, "description": "Late", "amount": 100, "overdueByDays": 15 }
  ],
  "studentList": ["stu-001"],
  "courseList": []
}

### Get fee by id
GET {{host}}/api/fee/{{feeId}}
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}
